led.'=>'Ẹ̀yà-àfikún PHP Redis (phpredis) kò sí lórí ẹ̀rọ-ìsìn yìí, nítorí náà a kò lè mú ìpamọ́-nǹkan ṣíṣẹ́.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'A ti fi ohun elo ifunni object-cache miiran sori ẹrọ tẹlẹ. Yọ kuro ki o to jẹ ki object-cache Zinn® le.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'A kò lè kọ fáìlì ìṣètò ìsopọ̀ Redis.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'A kò lè ka drop-in ìpamọ́-nǹkan tí a dì pọ̀.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'A kò lè fi drop-in ìpamọ́-nǹkan sí inú wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'A kò lè yọ drop-in ìpamọ́-nǹkan kúrò.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'A kò lè kọ sínú ètò-fáìlì WordPress, nítorí náà a kò lè ṣàkóso drop-in ìpamọ́-nǹkan.','This one-click login link is not valid any more. Links expire after a couple of minutes and can only be used once — open your site from the Zinn® dashboard again to get a fresh one.'=>'Ọna asopọ wọle tite-kan-ṣoṣo yii kii wulo mọ. Awọn ọna asopọ n parẹ lẹhin iṣẹju diẹ diẹ ati pe a le lo lẹẹkan ṣoṣo — ṣii aaye rẹ lati inu dasibodu Zinn® lẹẹkan si lati gba titun kan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ ìtújáde Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìmúdójúìwọ̀n tí a gbà sílẹ̀ kùnà àyẹ̀wò ìdúróṣinṣin rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sórí ẹ̀rọ.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — awọn amọna ati awọn iṣẹ','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́ olùṣe','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Gbale Zinn® fun WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfipamọ́ ojoojúmọ́, ìṣípò padà ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìṣàkóso tí a kọ́ fún àwọn èèyàn tí wọ́n ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí ju ojú òpó wẹ́bù kan lọ.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọja Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra àti tà àwọn ojú òpó wẹ́bù, àwọn àlẹ̀mọ́ domain, àti àwọn ibi ìjápọ̀ tí wọ́n ti wà tẹ́lẹ̀, pẹ̀lú owó tí a pa mọ́ láìléwu títí di ìgbà tí ẹ̀gbẹ́ méjèèjì yóò fi ní ìtẹ́lọ́rùn.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — gba awọn eniyan ti eyi jẹ iṣẹ wọn siṣẹ','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà alájọṣepọ̀ káríayé wa: wo àwọn iṣẹ́ tó ti ṣetan lórí ẹgbẹ̀rún mẹ́wàá láti ọ̀dọ̀ àwọn akọ̀wé, apẹ̀rẹ̀, olùgbékalẹ̀ àti òṣìṣẹ́ SEO, tàbí kí o fi iṣẹ́ kan sílẹ̀ kí o sì jẹ́ kí wọ́n fún ọ ní iye owó.']];